<topic template="Default" modified="2026-11-17T13:37:15.020Z" lasteditedby="robert" version="2" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../helpproject.xsd">
  <title>DELETE CONNECTION Command</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>Databases</keyword>
    <keyword>DELETE CONNECTION command</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">DELETE CONNECTION Command</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__FoxProOnly" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">用途</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">从当前数据库中删除一个命名连接。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">语法</para>
    <para styleclass="Code with box">DELETE CONNECTION &lt;ConnectionName&gt;</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参数</para>
    <para styleclass="List">&lt;ConnectionName&gt;<tab />必须删除的连接名称。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">备注</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">该命令会被预处理器转换为对 XSharp.RDD.Dbc 类中 DeleteConnection() 方法的调用。</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibVFP" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参见</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_CREATE_CONNECTION">CREATE CONNECTION</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_DELETE">DELETE</link></para>
  </body>
</topic>
